From: dresden196 <50474030+dresden196@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] os_install_service: lsblk may read links with readlinkat

NickelOS Unified runs Gentoo's util-linux, whose lsblk reads links with
readlinkat: the installer's disk list came back empty (lsblk killed by
this policy) and setup said it couldn't find a place to install.

---
--- a/conf/os_install_service-seccomp-amd64.policy
+++ b/conf/os_install_service-seccomp-amd64.policy
@@ -114,6 +114,8 @@
 pwrite64: 1
 read: 1
 readlink: 1
+# NickelOS Unified: Gentoo's util-linux lsblk reads links with readlinkat.
+readlinkat: 1
 recvmsg: 1
 restart_syscall: 1
 rt_sigaction: 1
